# Never publish build artefacts. Vitest's dependency optimiser writes its cache
# into ./node_modules relative to the project it loads, which lands here and was
# being served publicly (200 on macrohard.nz/node_modules/...). Content was
# harmless, but it reappears on every test run, so exclude it at the source of
# truth rather than remembering to delete it.
node_modules
.vite
.DS_Store
*.map
